<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Jan-June trade surplus up to $2.29 bln.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Jan-June trade surplus up to $2.29 bln.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's first half calendar 1996 trade surplus rose to $2.29 billion from $2.00 billion January-June 1995, trade ministry figures showed.</p>
<p>January-June exports rose to $23.49 billion from $21.24 billion in the same period in 1995. Imports also jumped to $21.19 billion from $19.25 billion.</p>
<p>Oil and gas exports rose to $5.42 billion from $5.27 billion.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
